ItemDisplay[NMAG !RW DAGGER !THROWING (FILTLVL~2-6 CLVL>79) !RWB_VENOM_DAGGER GROUND !TOWN SELLPRICE>24999 AREA<3]:%GRAY%(%TAN%$%GRAY%)//
