// Hide nonmagical orbs that are not Plague bases: on filter levels 2-6 from character level 80 (only a ($) shows when one sells for 25,000+ gold and takes 2 inventory squares or less), and on filter levels 7+
ItemDisplay[NMAG !RW SOR (FILTLVL~2-6 CLVL>79) !RWB_PLAGUE_ORB GROUND !TOWN SELLPRICE>24999 AREA<3]:%GRAY%(%TAN%$%GRAY%)//
